{"summary":"“Love You to Bits” is a crazy cute point-and-click adventure.","description":"“Love You to Bits” is a crazy cute, purely visual, puzzle-filled, point-and-click, sci-fi adventure spanning all around the universe.\n\nYou will follow the journey of Kosmo, a clumsy, rookie space explorer in search of Nova, his robot girlfriend. After a fatal accident, all of Nova’s pieces get scattered in outer space!  So now Kosmo wants to retrieve all Nova’s bits, rebuild her, and get back together. \n\nExplore the strangest worlds and planets, full of fantastic aliens, space-time puzzles, and hidden objects to collect. As you complete levels, you will discover Kosmo and Nova’s heartbreaking love story!\n\nUniversal\nExplore enigmatic planets full of mind-boggling puzzles to be solved! Meet and outsmart dozens of bizarre creatures and aliens from all around the universe!\n\nBreathtaking\nExperience and rebuild a thrilling love story for all audiences: pure visual-storytelling with stylized visuals and a hair-raising soundtrack!\n\nCute\nReconstruct the touching past of Kosmo and Nova by collecting dozens of their hidden love-tokens.\n\nDeveloped by Alike Studio and Pati.io","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Fear","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QPjuh86LH9c?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SDMHDXPsoLOp1BZ2e2S7RfJ_VRLr_wLJ8NVAn4h5suYnknPHxoefxNYaq4inBwo0EmQM799EGi6K97xrOSR798M","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9CvCwUaBMR2Z2SlJpif-ecfPUhG2MaCwHjpLOfJ3VXDAJjAphF8T_yWRHOxU3nUmVfIRDHYEgo-ZSQIcutUt2Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c0JwsG2RHUjkOYC26BzYZHrVEaPkfbU2AukifEg6Bj1qDzR1wmyX6yE2RMGyHe7eFby-LLy-Jveu1NgT8KDKIA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FsGLbRnQhcS6aVjMEjleC_Ya281kEfcex1MXrgzCF81QIfIKP_lwil08-RTmbLkXjbLH8e_HQ1wGSWG5GI1SMPE","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ab1S4Z6NZPnO44yJraO4uPm1G0T6BHWkcMtvnQU0_t0ms2Mg2w3Cesi-LhjZ16OjxKJSqeJLk1IZoVtVJQLEr